{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstabbarviewmodifier"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents22OUDSTabBarViewModifierV","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"OUDSTabBarViewModifier","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSTabBarViewModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSTabBarViewModifier","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines the look and feel the tab bar must have by applying the OUDS tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Changes only colors and typgraphies, and does not add additional items like indicator of selected tab or divider."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To use these elements in your tab view, use instead "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBar","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBarViewModifier"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBarViewModifier\/init()"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTabBarViewModifier\/body(content:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementatio